  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-27" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;8. Evergy Kansas South, Inc. has no employees. The employees of Evergy Kansas Central, Inc., its parent company, and Evergy Metro, Inc., an affiliate, allocate time to Evergy Kansas South, Inc.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
